      887.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "因为我的环境传啊 也不着急 周末在买 我先湊过两天啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0142",
    "t": [
      888.8,
      892.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我很有帽戏手了 你洗手了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0143",
    "t": [
      897.8,
      899.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你们俩出衣 我们俩十五啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0144",
    "t": [
      899.8,
      901.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "妈 你说这么大名啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0145",
    "t": [
      903.8,
      911.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "要不然这样 咱出去 咱就坐在那儿 光吃饭 什么话都不说 他们咱们咱们边来吃饭吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0146",
    "t": [
      911.8,
      917.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "吃 我们先出去 我回头等你们吃饭 我再吃"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0147",
    "t": [
      918.8,
      924.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你什么意思啊 你怎么一到关键适合你 不跟我统一站好了呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0148",
    "t": [
      924.8,
      928.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我真的不知道 我不知道我说什么 那我说什么呀 我出去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0149",
    "t": [
      932.8,
      933.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我马上就来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0150",
    "t": [
      935.8,
      936.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "不说话"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0151",
    "t": [
      936.8,
      942.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "来了 你爸的手 从来没这么白过啊 就是啊 没洗过这么赶紧的手"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0152",
    "t": [
      942.8,
      944.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "手脚正赶紧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0153",
    "t": [
      944.8,
      952.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "刚才啊 我跟妈妈 不仅洗赶紧了手 他言计了一下 给你们天太这样的事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0154",
    "t": [
      952.8,
      955.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "我知道 你不会让我们失望地"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0155",
    "t": [
      955.8,
      959.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "你老妈 我也知道 你也不会让我们失望地"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0156",
    "t": [
      959.8,
      965.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我也知道 你们是非常关心我们 我非常爱我们的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0157",
    "t": [
      965.8,
      967.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "对 对"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0158",
    "t": [
      970.8,
      972.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我刚才好像没打肥皂"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0159",
    "t": [
      972.8,
      975.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "喝喝喝喝水皂 我也没打肥皂"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0160",
    "t": [
      988.8,
      990.8
    ],
    "speaker": "ENSEMBLE",
    "text": "妈妈 我回来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0161",
    "t": [
      991.8,
      994.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "来了 你来了 爸 妈呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0162",
    "t": [
      994.8,
      1000.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "他们不回来吃了 老老给做饭 对 当得了当"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0163",
    "t": [
      1000.8,
      1004.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "他们肯定是去给我联系网站 给我祖福气去了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0164",
    "t": [
      1006.8,
      1007.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我回来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0165",
    "t": [
      1010.8,
      1022.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "来了 你来了 爸 妈呢 他们俩不回来吃饭了 老老给做饭 肯定是去电脑城 给我看 笔记本 电脑圈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0166",
    "t": [
      1024.8,
      1026.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我回来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0167",
    "t": [
      1028.8,
      1032.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "爸 妈 来 妈 你来了 爸 妈 妈呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0168",
    "t": [
      1032.8,
      1040.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "他们俩不回来吃了 老老给做饭 爸 爸 爸 爸 肯定请多买花姐床了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0169",
    "t": [
      1043.8,
      1051.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "计划生育多 让这么一堆糟糕的孩子 操多受心闹"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0170",
    "t": [
      1077.8,
      1078.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "小什么呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0171",
    "t": [
      1078.8,
      1081.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "爸 来 妈 到底去干什么了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0172",
    "t": [
      1093.8,
      1099.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "你们俩想什么呢 我们妈到底去干什么了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0173",
    "t": [
      1107.8,
      1112.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "要好 怎么都跟这儿待着呀 干吗不回家呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0174",
    "t": [
      1112.8,
      1114.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "老老 我怎么吃妈妈做的饭"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0175",
    "t": [
      1114.8,
      1117.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我也想吃 老老做的不好吃"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0176",
    "t": [
      1117.8,
      1122.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "不是 她们俩是想问 爸 妈妈干嘛去了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0177",
    "t": [
      1122.8,
      1130.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "你妈说了 让你们在坚持几天 等她回来就给你们做好吃的 爸 妈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0178",
    "t": [
      1130.8,
      1133.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "坚持一个星期怎么还坚持"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0179",
    "t": [
      1133.8,
      1138.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "对呀 她们为什么每天走出晚归 沉沉秘秘的呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0180",
    "t": [
      1138.8,
      1142.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你告诉我 爸 妈妈到底干嘛去呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0181",
    "t": [
      1142.8,
      1144.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "她们去来呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0182",
    "t": [
      1144.8,
      1145.8
    ],
    "speaker": "ENSEMBLE",
    "text": "去她们"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0183",
    "t": [
      1145.8,
      1149.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "她们不要说 老老"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0184",
    "t": [
      1149.8,
      1153.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "她们肯定拿着高费 出去花点牛地去了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0185",
    "t": [
      1153.8,
      1157.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "她们一定是归一躲着我们 她们太不像话"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0186",
    "t": [
      1157.8,
      1170.8
    ],
    "speaker": "姥姥",
    "text": "瞧瞧你们这些孩子 她说什么呀 你们呀是太不了解 爸爸妈妈的心思了 你爸爸妈妈呀 她们正在为了你们呀 练功啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0187",
    "t": [
      1172.8,
      1174.8
    ],
    "speaker": "ENSEMBLE",
    "text": "练功"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0188",
    "t": [
      1175.8,
      1179.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "是九英白姑长 还是小龙十八长"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0189",
    "t": [
      1179.8,
      1181.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我 来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0190",
    "t": [
      1187.8,
      1189.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "练功啊 是"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0191",
    "t": [
      1190.8,
      1192.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "后孩子们都睡啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0192",
    "t": [
      1193.8,
      1196.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "这烤业你猜死我了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0193",
    "t": [
      1196.8,
      1200.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那我这不是有点年老体胖 身体碰撞"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0194",
    "t": [
      1201.8,
      1202.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你累不累"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0195",
    "t": [
      1202.8,
      1203.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "干吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0196",
    "t": [
      1203.8,
      1207.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "有关三两在 练婚 不理财务了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0197",
    "t": [
      1207.8,
      1209.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没问题 过来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0198",
    "t": [
      1210.8,
      1220.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "大姐 一 打 二 打 三 你还来她们每天来呢 回来这么晚就干这 冰都不清"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0199",
    "t": [
      1220.8,
      1223.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "还有咱们认识的这样子"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0200",
    "t": [
      1224.8,
      1227.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "能当你没看懂吗 傻瓜"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0201",
    "t": [
      1232.8,
      1234.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你们干什么呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0202",
    "t": [
      1234.8,
      1237.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "我们 我走 干点来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0203",
    "t": [
      1237.8,
      1239.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "那你们跳舞干什么"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0204",
    "t": [
      1239.8,
      1242.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "肯定有事 说实话"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0205",
    "t": [
      1242.8,
      1246.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我们就是 随便看这个 过去教育我比赛什么"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0206",
    "t": [
      1247.8,
      1249.8
    ],
    "speaker": "ENSEMBLE",
    "text": "为什么呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0207",
    "t": [
      1249.8,
      1253.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "为什么呀 傻呀 还不是为了给咱们买大件"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0208",
    "t": [
      1253.8,
      1257.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "给咱们买东西 跟参加比赛有什么关系"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0209",
    "t": [
      1258.8,
      1263.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "是这么回事 我们参加这个教育五大赛 它是有奖金的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0210",
    "t": [
      1263.8,
      1265.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "对 一等奖三万块"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0211",
    "t": [
      1265.8,
      1284.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "二等奖了两万 三等奖 一万块 对 只有一万块点奖金 可是 希望能满足你们三个人的愿望 还差点前 所以我们想万一 我们要是能得上一等奖 我们不光可以满足你们的愿望 我们还能留下一万块钱的机器"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0212",
    "t": [
      1284.8,
      1289.8
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "对 等于是得了二等奖 那就 整好实现你们三个人的愿望"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
    "unit_id": "u0213",
    "t": [
      1289.8,
      1292.8
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我们要是得了三等奖 那就少了一万块钱"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "014",
